                    <span class="dateline">
                        <span class="toLocalTime" data-tlt-epoch-time="1343241900">Wednesday, Jul 25, 2012 6:45 PM UTC</span>                    </span>

                    <h1><a href="http://www.salon.com/2012/07/25/dont_bust_bogus_hype/">Don&#8217;t bust bogus &#8220;hype&#8221;</a></h1>
					<h2>Why Salon's article on Reddit's Aurora reporting ticked me off</h2>
					
					<span class='byline'>By <A href='http://www.salon.com/writer/jay_rosen/' rel='author'>Jay Rosen</A></span>
                        <ul 
        class="shareTools" 
        data-share-link="http://www.salon.com/2012/07/25/dont_bust_bogus_hype/" 
