                    <h1><a href="http://www.salon.com/2008/01/21/campaign_coverage/">Why campaign coverage sucks</a></h1>
					<h2>Horse-race journalism works for journalists and fails the public.</h2>
					
					<span class='byline'>By <A href='http://www.salon.com/writer/jay_rosen/' rel='author'>Jay Rosen</A></span>
                        <ul 
