                    <h1><a href="http://www.salon.com/2006/04/20/mclellan_2/">Nullifying the press</a></h1>
					<h2>The Bush team served up Scott McClellan's stolid stonewalling as the perfect device to humiliate and demote the media. And reporters played along.</h2>
					
					<span class='byline'>By <A href='http://www.salon.com/writer/jay_rosen/' rel='author'>Jay Rosen</A></span>
                        <ul 
        class="shareTools" 
        data-share-link="http://www.salon.com/2006/04/20/mclellan_2/" 
