                    <h1><a href="http://www.salon.com/2003/10/10/postman/">Neil Postman: A civilized man in a century of barbarism</a></h1>
					<h2>A former student remembers a teacher who never stopped raking the worlds of Big Media and technology with his savage wit.</h2>
					
					<span class='byline'>By <A href='http://www.salon.com/writer/jay_rosen/' rel='author'>Jay Rosen</A></span>
